==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|sharply}}, {{m|enm|scharply}}, from {{inh|en|ang|sċearplīċe|t=sharply, smartly}}, equivalent to {{af|en|sharp|-ly}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|GA}} {{IPA|/ʃɑɹpli/|lang=en}}
* {{a|RP}} {{IPA|/ʃɑːpli/|lang=en}}
* {{audio|en-us-sharply.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}

